        "expected_query": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION calculate_discount(price NUMERIC, discount_pct NUMERIC)\nRETURNS NUMERIC AS $$\nBEGIN\n    RETURN ROUND(price * (1 - discount_pct / 100.0), 2);\nEND;\n$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;",
