        "expected_query": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION calculate_sales_tax(subtotal NUMERIC, tax_rate NUMERIC)\nRETURNS NUMERIC AS $$\nBEGIN\n    RETURN ROUND(subtotal * (tax_rate / 100.0), 2);\nEND;\n$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;",
